// The gears sample's Hypoid tab (`cadrs_core::samples::gears::build_hypoid_in`): two shafts,
// the pinion's moved by two Transforms, and the hypoid pair picking the shafts' cylinders. Then
// the Rotate's angle set to 10°: both gears follow the pinion's shaft.
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        SetTimeout(180.0),
        Custom("hypoid"),
        Key("Shift+7"),
        Key("F"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(10),
        Screenshot("01-the-pair-on-its-shafts"),
    ],
)
